WEBVTT

00:00:01.020 --> 00:00:04.816
Gooby: Hi! I'm Gooby. My goal is for you to delete me.

00:00:05.356 --> 00:00:06.387
Narrator: Let us explain.

00:00:09.427 --> 00:00:12.732
Narrator: This is Robin. It's her first week using Claude Code.

00:00:13.272 --> 00:00:18.348
Narrator: She doesn't know what she doesn't know. And no one is sitting next to her to help.

00:00:18.888 --> 00:00:20.764
Robin: Um. Hello? Computer?

00:00:21.604 --> 00:00:25.376
Narrator: Meet Gooby. A tiny buddy that lives right beside her Terminal.

00:00:25.916 --> 00:00:31.418
Narrator: Move the window, and Gooby follows. Short on room? It hops to the other side.

00:00:31.958 --> 00:00:36.903
Narrator: It only follows Claude chats. Hover over it, and it tells you which project you're in.

00:00:37.443 --> 00:00:42.191
Narrator: No Claude chat in front? It ducks behind the edge of the screen, and peeks.

00:00:42.731 --> 00:00:46.119
Narrator: It never steals your typing, and it never reads your screen.

00:00:46.659 --> 00:00:49.498
Narrator: Think of it as training wheels, for AI.

00:00:50.438 --> 00:00:57.206
Narrator: Monday, Robin asks Claude to commit and push her code. Tuesday, again. Wednesday, again.

00:00:57.746 --> 00:01:02.922
Narrator: With the skill coach on, Gooby notices. 5 chats. Same request.

00:01:03.462 --> 00:01:07.622
Gooby: You've asked me to commit and push in 5 chats. Want a shortcut?

00:01:08.162 --> 00:01:13.268
Narrator: One click, and Gooby builds her a skill, from what Claude actually did those five times.

00:01:13.808 --> 00:01:16.047
Robin: Ooh. /gooby-commit-and-push.

00:01:18.987 --> 00:01:25.056
Narrator: Week two. Robin asks why her payments are failing. Claude answers. Thoroughly.

00:01:25.596 --> 00:01:28.726
Gooby: Wow, that's a lot. Want me to simplify it?

00:01:29.266 --> 00:01:33.642
Narrator: Three plain sentences. Robin gets it. Robin fixes it.

00:01:35.982 --> 00:01:41.110
Narrator: Week three. Robin is running three Claude chats at once. Which one was which?

00:01:41.650 --> 00:01:45.710
Narrator: Gooby glides to whichever chat is in front, and tells her the project.

00:01:46.250 --> 00:01:48.908
Robin: Got it. Billing. Thanks, Gooby.

00:01:52.048 --> 00:01:54.623
Narrator: Week by week, the training wheels matter less.

00:01:55.163 --> 00:02:00.966
Narrator: Gooby is built to help new users get productive sooner, and grow from beginner to expert, faster.

00:02:01.506 --> 00:02:05.633
Robin: Thanks, Gooby. I think I'm okay to try this on my own now.

00:02:06.173 --> 00:02:07.601
Gooby: Yes! Finally!

00:02:08.141 --> 00:02:13.955
Narrator: That's the whole point. When you don't need the tips anymore, you delete Gooby. That's success.

00:02:15.695 --> 00:02:19.177
Narrator: As for Gooby? It retires to a villa in rural Italy.

00:02:19.717 --> 00:02:20.099
Gooby: Ciao!

00:02:22.439 --> 00:02:29.067
Narrator: Gooby. Learn faster, need Gooby less. Available now for every Mac user, with Claude Code.
